Types of GANs


| GAN Type               | Simple Meaning                       | Use                                 |
| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |
| Vanilla GAN            | Basic GAN model                      | Learning GAN concepts               |
| CGAN (Conditional GAN) | Generates images based on conditions | Generate specific objects           |
| DCGAN                  | Uses Convolutional Neural Networks   | Image generation                    |
| CycleGAN               | Converts one image style to another  | Horse ↔ Zebra                       |
| Text-to-Image GAN      | Creates image from text description  | "Generate a cat wearing sunglasses" |
| StyleGAN               | Creates highly realistic faces       | Face generation                     |
| SRGAN                  | Improves image resolution            | Image enhancement                   |


