Why GANs are Important?

GANs can:

✅ Generate realistic human faces
✅ Create artwork
✅ Convert image styles
✅ Improve image quality
✅ Create deepfake videos
✅ Generate synthetic data for AI training

One-Line Interview Answer

"GAN (Generative Adversarial Network) is a deep learning model that uses 
a Generator and a Discriminator network to create realistic new data such as images, faces, artwork, and videos."
